ored member, 4 epochs instead of 2 | 0.2927 (flat — rejected) |\n| anchored member, no option-set augmentation (full anchor coverage) | 0.2924 (rejected) |\n| six members instead of five | 0.2949-0.2956 (no gain, costs time — rejected) |\n| continuous anchored/unanchored family weight | 0.2964 at the grid edge (contradicted by the discrete sweep — rejected) |\n\nComposition sweep at fixed size (anchored members out of five): 0.2947 / 0.2944 / 0.2950 /\n**0.2955** / 0.2957 / 0.2943 for 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 anchored. The shipped 3/2 mix is inside the\noptimum and the curve is flat across it.\"\"\")\nq.write_text(t); print(\"notes updated\")\nPYEOF\nvalidate-candidate --json | head -4; /opt/kev-venv/bin/python /opt/kev-runtime/evaluate_public.py --candidate /workspace/candidate 2>/dev/null | /opt/kev-venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport json,sys; m=json.load(sys.stdin)['metrics']\nprint('public dev reward %.4f  macro %.4f  knowledge %.4f  other %.4f'%(m['reward'],m['macro_nll'],m['groups']['knowledge']['nll'],m['groups']['other']['nll']))\"\n/opt/kev-venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport json; c=json.load(open('/workspace/candidate/checkpoint/members.json'))\nprint('shipped members:', [(x['dir'], x['source_run']) for x in c['members']], 'combine', c['combine'], 'letter_shifts', c['letter_shifts'])\"","description":"Record findings and verify final state","timeout":2400000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2486,"cache_read_input_tokens":573682,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2486},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"560ecfb8-442b-496c-96fc-76248767870b","uuid":"3d34d467-6ca0-4554-b56b-aa3eac3a890d","request_id":"req_011CfJ5m3LXLYoPQUoEZJ1A4"}
