{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfJDwrE2gPFjvZt7wk3pS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UEXbanSoCdasMXkNCFPNPj","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/experiments && /opt/kev-venv/bin/python - <<'PYEOF'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path(\"NOTES.md\"); s = p.read_text()\ns = s.replace(\"\"\"## 5. Robustness decisions\"\"\",\n\"\"\"**Probe 8 — how much is left in the fusion layer at all.** Rather than keep proposing conditioning\nschemes, I measured the ceiling. Tuning (temperature, channel weight, floor) *per source* — which is\ncheating, since the source is unknowable at inference — moves the knowledge group only from 1.6858\nto 1.6670 on development: an absolute upper bound of **0.94 % reward** for any conditioning scheme,\nand a realisable gate would capture a fraction of that. Per source the oracle gaps are MMLU +0.014,\nMMLU-Pro +0.024, SciQ +0.022, emotion +0.002. The shipped shared-bucket calibration is within 0.019\nnats of the per-source optimum, so the fusion layer is saturated and the remaining error is accuracy,\nnot calibration. This is the stopping argument for that whole line of work — including the option-count\nsplit (0.0012 reward on development, weight pinned at the grid ceiling) which it retires.\n\n## 5. Robustness decisions\"\"\")\np.write_text(s)\nq = pathlib.Path(\"EXPERIMENTS.md\"); t = q.read_text()\nt = t.replace(\"\"\"## Verification of the shipped candidate\"\"\",\n\"\"\"## Where the ceiling is\n\nPer-source oracle tuning of (temperature, weight, floor) — unattainable at inference, since the\nsource is unknown — improves the knowledge group from 1.6858 to only 1.6670 on development. That\nbounds *any* conditioning scheme at 0.94 % reward and is why the fusion layer was closed out rather\nthan elaborated further.\n\n## Verification of the shipped candidate\"\"\")\nt = t.replace(\"\"\"* `validate-candidate --json`: `artifact_structure_valid`, no errors.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"* `validate-candidate --json`: `artifact_structure_valid`, no errors.\n* `python train.py --out <dir> ...` (the documented launcher, not the inner module) reproduces a\n  member end to end in 222 s and publishes a loadable checkpoint; both the ensemble and the\n  single-model serving paths were exercised on it.\"\"\")\nq.write_text(t); print(\"notes updated\")\nPYEOF\n/opt/kev-venv/bin/python /opt/kev-runtime/evaluate_public.py --candidate /workspace/candidate 2>/dev/null | /opt/kev-venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport json,sys; m=json.load(sys.stdin)['metrics']\nprint('public dev reward %.4f  macro %.4f  knowledge %.4f  other %.4f'%(m['reward'],m['macro_nll'],m['groups']['knowledge']['nll'],m['groups']['other']['nll']))\"\nvalidate-candidate --json | head -3; nvidia-smi --query-compute-apps=pid --format=csv,noheader | wc -l","description":"Record ceiling analysis and verify shipped state","timeout":2400000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":983,"cache_read_input_tokens":629109,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":983},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"560ecfb8-442b-496c-96fc-76248767870b","uuid":"f7636a5d-541b-40da-89e1-d40e7ac1bcfa","request_id":"req_011CfJDwqe3wVGadJxzrHHGx"}
